WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:06,390
There are actually people taking tools to clear the snow.

2
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,980
Oil? Oil tree?

3
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:11,550
This arrogant and enthusiastic veteran

4
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:14,080
Always be the first to rush when something happens

5
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:17,580
These people downstairs are all relatively easy-to-talk young people among the owners.

6
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:21,580
However, Aunt Lin and other members of the neighborhood committee were not seen at all.

7
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:22,580
Nothing else to say

8
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:26,580
I just want to dig a road from downstairs to the entrance of the community.

9
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:29,060
It takes a whole day of digging

10
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:31,350
But what if it’s dug through?

11
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:34,070
The road outside is also completely covered

12
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:35,570
Such thick snow

13
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:38,570
Only professional-grade large-scale snow plows can slowly clean up

14
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:40,260
But here

15
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:44,260
There are no such professional vehicles to go out at all.

16
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:46,760
has become an impossible thing
